title: "Nitrogen Fixation Logic"
---
%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor': '#e8f4fd', 'primaryTextColor': '#000000', 'primaryBorderColor': '#333333', 'lineColor': '#333333', 'secondaryColor': '#f0f0f0', 'tertiaryColor': '#ffffff', 'background': '#ffffff', 'mainBkg': '#e8f4fd', 'nodeBorder': '#333333', 'clusterBkg': '#ffffff', 'titleColor': '#000000', 'edgeLabelBackground': '#ffffff'}}}%%
flowchart TD
    A["Start: Each time step,<br/>each cell K,I,<br/>each algal group JA"] --> B{"CRIT_TIN(JA) > 0?<br/>(N-fixation enabled<br/>for this group)"}
    B -- No --> C["Normal nitrogen-limited growth:<br/>ANLIM = TIN / (TIN + AHSN)<br/>NH4 and NO3 uptake active"]
    B -- Yes --> D{"NH4(K,I) + NO3(K,I)<br/>< CRIT_TIN(JA)?<br/>(TIN below threshold)"}
    D -- No --> C

    D -- Yes --> E["N-Fixation Active"]

    E --> F["Override N-limitation:<br/>ANLIM = TIN / (TIN + 0.0 + NONZERO)<br/>≈ 1.0 (no limitation)"]
    F --> G["Suppress NH4 uptake:<br/>skip NH4AG accumulation<br/>for this group"]
    G --> H["Suppress NO3 uptake:<br/>skip NO3AG accumulation<br/>for this group"]
    H --> I["Algae grow as if nitrogen<br/>were abundant, obtaining N<br/>from atmospheric N2"]

    C --> J["Compute growth rate:<br/>AGR = ATRM * AG * LIMIT<br/>where LIMIT = min(APLIM, ANLIM,<br/>ASLIM, ALLIM)"]
    I --> J

    C --> K["Accumulate uptake:<br/>NH4AG += AGR * ALG * AN * NH4PR<br/>NO3AG += AGR * ALG * NO3PR * AN"]

    J --> Z["End"]
    K --> Z
